  "The core product works, and works unusually well — nothing in the negative data touches the concept: 244 reviews (29.72%, high-priority, mean 4.54) describe a concrete behaviour change or motivational benefit; 203 (24.73%, 4.30) praise the art/cuteness; 60 (7.31%, 4.25) praise the clean-the-room loop; 40 (4.87%, 4.15) describe emotional attachment to the rabbit — 'cleaning this stupid bunny's stupid room is what finally got me to stick to one'; 'Habit Rabbit has done what others could not do… make me feel guilty. :)'; 'Habit rabbit made me lose 80 pounds'; 'I take my iron pill just to check it off my list'; the gamification loop is a genuine differentiator, and it is being spent on ad inventory",
